Swift test data in samples/extras/swift/

  Mangled names from the Swift project's test/Demangle/Inputs/manglings.txt (Apache License v2.0
  with Runtime Library Exception) and symbol names from Maccy 2.8.0 (https://github.com/p0deje/Maccy,
  MIT), each with the output of swift-demangle 6.0.3.

